WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:04.144
Toad banged the table angrily.

2
00:00:04.145 --> 00:00:08.170
"The Wild-Wooders had guns?" he said.

3
00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:11.069
"Yes, they did," said Rat.

4
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.317
"What happened?" asked Toad.

5
00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:18.783
Rat told him everything.

6
00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:23.531
"It was a dark, rainy night," said Rat.

7
00:00:23.532 --> 00:00:26.325
"Our friends were sitting by the fire."

8
00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:29.705
Toad listened closely.

9
00:00:29.706 --> 00:00:33.439
"A pack of Wild-Wooders hid outside.

10
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.093
The weasels came in the front.

11
00:00:36.094 --> 00:00:38.795
The ferrets came in the back.

12
00:00:38.796 --> 00:00:42.699
It was a surprise attack!" said Rat.

13
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:47.101
"What did Mole and Badger do?" asked Toad.

14
00:00:47.102 --> 00:00:49.642
"Nothing," said Rat.

15
00:00:49.643 --> 00:00:53.937
"They were only two animals against so many.

16
00:00:53.938 --> 00:00:56.829
The bullies beat them!"

17
00:00:56.830 --> 00:01:00.101
Toad patted Rat’s hand. "They

18
00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:04.408
kicked Mole and Badger out," said Rat. "The

19
00:01:04.409 --> 00:01:08.564
Wild-Wooders moved into Toad Hall." "Oh

20
00:01:08.565 --> 00:01:11.962
my!" said Toad. "Your

21
00:01:11.963 --> 00:01:15.305
house is a mess!" said Rat. "The

22
00:01:15.306 --> 00:01:19.008
weasels eat all your food. The

23
00:01:19.009 --> 00:01:22.730
ferrets drink all your drinks." "Why,

24
00:01:22.731 --> 00:01:27.623
I’ll . . . ," cried Toad, shaking. "And

25
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:31.354
they joke about you!" cried Rat. "They

26
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:35.257
sing awful songs! Listen: When

27
00:01:35.258 --> 00:01:39.768
Toady went out on the trail, He

28
00:01:39.769 --> 00:01:43.667
never thought he would fail. But

29
00:01:43.668 --> 00:01:45.767
he drove too fast, His

30
00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:48.514
fun didn’t last. Now

31
00:01:48.515 --> 00:01:51.544
Toady sits in jail! Oh!

32
00:01:51.545 --> 00:02:01.422
Toady’s locked in jail! "

